# Merge these rules into the host's existing inet filter input chain.
# Do not load this file unchanged unless that table and chain already exist.
# Keep the host's management access rule before enabling a default-drop policy.

add rule inet filter input iifname "lo" accept comment "local health checks"
add rule inet filter input ct state established,related accept
add rule inet filter input tcp dport { 6667, 28910 } ct state new accept comment "FruitSpy TCP"
add rule inet filter input udp dport { 27900, 27901 } accept comment "FruitSpy UDP"
